<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107885" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτελ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overleaping</i>: of a
			beacon, <i>leaping over the strait,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				286
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>rising</i> or <i>appearing above,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς οἴκων . . ὑ. . . θεῶν;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1549
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθλων ὑ.</span>
			<i>one who has reached the end</i> of his labours, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of numbers
			the sum of whose factors (including unity) <i>is greater than
				themselves</i> (such as <i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>, because <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> + <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i> + <i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i> + <i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i> + <i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>
			=
			<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>), opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλλιπεῖς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Mart.Cap.
				7.753
			</span></i>; of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονάς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτέλειος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of payments,
				<i>due</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				1.66.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
